      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effects of a beta-blocker (bunitrolol, Koe 1366) on the distribution of myocardial blood flow from the underperfused left circumflex coronary artery were examined by tracer microsphere method. Koe 1366 increased subendocardial/subepicardial flow ratio without increase of a net flow in the underperfused left ventricle."},
